  lines:
  - speaker: 
    text: "Cik! Buras\u0131 zifiri karanl\u0131k... Me\u015Faleni sak\u0131n d\xFC\u015F\xFCrme!"
  - speaker: Sen
    text: "Merak etme F\u0131nd\u0131k. Prensesi bulmadan geri d\xF6nmek yok."
  - speaker: 
    text: "\xDC\xE7 kap\u0131 varm\u0131\u015F, sadece biri d\u0131\u015Far\u0131 \xE7\u0131kar\u0131yor. Tak\u0131l\u0131rsan T\u2019ye bas, bana sor!"
  playOnce: 1
